@r115_raw_concept System is anti-fragile iff Effectiveness_post_perturbation > Effectiveness_pre_perturbation (NOT just robust = ≥). Perturbation menu for airgenome: noise injection on vitals, axis-jitter, ssh-timeout simulation, host-dropout, adversarial-process spawn.
