@r115_minimal_reproducer_pointer core/core.hexa AdaptiveThrottle section (current_rss_mb fn at line 79+ + assess fn at lines 58-73) — already implements adaptive throttle on CPU/RAM/Swap thresholds; add explicit pre/post-perturbation effectiveness measurement protocol.
@r115_tracking_id airgenome/convergence/issues/TBD-r115-anti-fragility-sweep
