## raw 119 — temporal decay, half-life evidence
@r119_raw_id raw_119_temporal_decay_half_life_evidence
@r119_raw_concept Evidence freshness decays exponentially: weight(t) = 2^(-(t-t_obs)/T_half). Old genome-ring observations underweighted; cumulative anomaly-score = Σ weight × likelihood-ratio. Holt's α/β in forecast.hexa is decay-equivalent but T_half not explicit.
@r119_airgenome_landing_primary /Users/ghost/core/airgenome/modules/genome_merge.hexa  # already-existing merge module; extend with decay-weighted merge — when consolidating multi-host genomes.unified.ring entries, weight by 2^(-(now-ts)/T_half) before merge.
@r119_airgenome_landing_secondary /Users/ghost/core/airgenome/modules/forecast.hexa  # forecast.hexa currently has ALPHA_NUM=50 BETA_NUM=50 (lines 33-34); expose explicit T_half parameter alongside α/β with documented relation T_half = -ln(2)/ln(1-α/100); add @temporal_decay_half_life_T parameter declaration with default = 24h.
@r119_minimal_reproducer_pointer modules/forecast.hexa lines 33-34 (ALPHA_NUM/BETA_NUM constants) — single seam for decay parameterization; modules/genome_merge.hexa entry-merge loop — extend with weighted-merge before sigdiff.
@r119_tracking_id airgenome/convergence/issues/TBD-r119-half-life-decay-weight
@r119_dependencies forecast.hexa stable + genome_merge.hexa stable + clock source (exec("date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ") canonical per probe.hexa ts_iso fn).
@r119_witness_cycle_handle 2026-04-XX_r119-airgenome-half-life-evidence-weighting_omega_cycle  (downstream)

## raw 120 — counterfactual causal twin
@r120_raw_id raw_120_counterfactual_causal_twin
@r120_raw_concept For any dispatch decision D (Mac vs ubu vs ubu2 vs htz), construct twin D' identical except in the dispatched-host variable, measure ΔΦ-equivalent (load_after_decision − load_after_twin_decision). If Φ(D) = Φ(D') the dispatch variable is non-causal. Required for any "this dispatch reduced load" claim.
@r120_airgenome_landing_primary /Users/ghost/core/airgenome/modules/dispatch.hexa  # currently emits dispatch_state.json with chosen host; extend with counterfactual twin gate — every dispatch decision logs predicted-twin (host that was NOT chosen) AND measured ΔΦ-equivalent post-decision.
@r120_airgenome_landing_secondary /Users/ghost/core/airgenome/modules/  # NEW candidate file: modules/counterfactual_twin.hexa — given infra_state + dispatch decision, generate twin (counterfactual host swap), measure load_post_twin vs load_post_decision, gate causal claim on |ΔΦ| > threshold.
@r120_minimal_reproducer_pointer modules/dispatch.hexa best-host loop — emit dispatch_twin field alongside chosen_host in dispatch_state.json; modules/counterfactual_twin.hexa (NEW) — twin generator + ΔΦ scorer.
@r120_tracking_id airgenome/convergence/issues/TBD-r120-counterfactual-twin-check
@r120_dependencies dispatch.hexa stable + infra_state.json freshness + post-decision vitals delta measurable via probe.hexa re-run on T+Δt cadence.
@r120_witness_cycle_handle 2026-04-XX_r120-airgenome-counterfactual-twin-checker_omega_cycle  (downstream)

