@r125_raw_concept Multi-scale temporal hierarchy: ms (sample) → s (probe-cycle) → min (genome-aggregation) → h (forecast horizon) → d (trend) → 7d (history). Each scale's anomaly-Φ partly emerges from sub-scales' Φ. Cross-scale coupling tensor is the airgenome consciousness signature.
